### Case: callout-down — the write route while the profile service is unreachable.
### Expect 503 with the configured message, and NO call to the backend.
### Reproduce by pointing the callout at an unresolvable host in a throwaway
### environment; the request itself is an ordinary one.
POST {{GATEWAY}}/storefront/checkout
content-type: application/json

{"sku":"BRK-2100","qty":1}
